Title: Judge's Crossword Puzzle No. 35
Author: H. S. Gumanow
Date: 1925-06-27
Byline: The above Puzzle was contributed by H. S. Gumanow, 168 Williams avenue, Brooklyn, New York.
Source: https://archive.org/details/sim_judge_1925-06-27_88/page/n34/mode/1up
